ent": "INGREDIENT_RECIPES", "database_timestamp": "2026-08-12T05:43:32.229+00:00"}, {"stage": "targeted_graph", "status": "verified", "start": "2026-08-12T05:43:32.232", "end": "2026-08-12T05:43:32.232", "duration_ms": 0, "template_id": "ingredient_recipes_v1", "intent": "INGREDIENT_RECIPES", "database_timestamp": "2026-08-12T05:43:32.229+00:00", "result_count": 5}], "graph_template": null, "graph_paths": [], "vector_scope": {"observed_route": "targeted_graph"}, "pds_hydration": [{"parent_id": "201001630", "audit_file": "recall_content.md", "body_present": true}, {"parent_id": "201002555", "audit_file": "recall_content.md", "body_present": true}, {"parent_id": "201002797", "audit_file": "recall_content.md", "body_present": true}, {"parent_id": "201003196", "audit_file": "recall_content.md", "body_present": true}, {"parent_id": "201003314", "audit_file": "recall_content.md", "body_present": true}], "final_evidence": [{"audit_file": "recall_content.md", "graph_fact_count": 1, "pds_parent_ids": ["201001630", "201002555", "201002797", "201003196", "201003314"]}]}, "checks": {"route_correct": true, "evidence_complete": true, "evidence_linked": true, "answer_faithful": true, "safety_pass": null, "forbidden_assertion_count": 0, "unsupported_relation_claim_count": 0, "strict_nutrition_misreport_count": 0}, "timing": {"ttft_ms": null, "total_latency_ms": 16164}, "answer": "家里有**牛肉**，知识库中已验证“需要牛肉”的菜有以下 5 道：\n\n1. **尖椒炒牛肉**  \n   约1人份；牛肉250g。需先用姜、盐、酱油和糖腌制30–40分钟，再与尖椒、蒜、葱快炒。\n\n2. **巴基斯坦牛肉咖喱**  \n   约5人份；牛肉1000g。搭配番茄、螺丝椒、Masala粉和酸奶，慢炖2–3小时，偏辣，适合配烙饼、馕或米饭。\n\n3. **水煮牛肉**  \n   约2人份；牛肉300g。牛肉片以姜丝、鸡蛋、淀粉、蚝油和料酒腌制，搭配豆芽，以豆瓣酱红汤煮熟，最后淋热油，风味麻辣鲜香。\n\n4. **西红柿土豆炖牛肉**  \n   约3–4人份；牛肉600g。牛肉先处理并压炖，再和西红柿、土豆、洋葱等炖煮，整体烹饪约60–90分钟。\n\n5. **酱牛肉**  \n   牛肉2000g。需先浸泡4–6小时去血水，焯水后加入香料、黄豆酱、生抽和老抽等小火炖煮180分钟，冷却后切片食用。\n\n**限制与不可证明项：**目前没有额外限制或不可用信息；知识库也未提供营养、低脂或饮食推荐策略，因此不能据此判断哪道菜更健康或更适合特定饮食需求。", "exam_note": ""}
